# ── Assignment meta files (not part of the project) ──────────────────────
# Scaffolding for the work, not deliverables. The design spec in
# housing-platform/ is kept locally but untracked — README.md is the
# single documented entry point for this repo.
housing-platform/
AGENTS.md
idea-hub.md
project_requirements.md
raff.txt

# Postman desktop app's workspace sync. When a Postman workspace is linked
# to this folder, the app mirrors EVERY collection in that workspace here,
# including other projects'. Only the curated collection in
# postman/Housing Platform API/ and its environment file are tracked.
postman/.postman/
postman/postman/

# Phases workflow (phases.json is the contract; phases/ folder is tooling)
phases/
phases.json
phases.schema.json
